Maintainer: Norah Efosa <norah-efosa@protonmail.com>
Description: Project the development of the population at different spatial levels 
    (e.g., cantons, districts, municipalities) using the cohort component method, 
    broken down by 101 one-year age classes, gender, and nationality (see e.g.
    [Preston, Guillot, and Heuveline, 2000](<https://www.wiley.com/en-us/Demography%3A+Measuring+and+Modeling+Population+Processes-p-9781557864512>)). 
    Includes helper functions to download required population data and projection 
    parameters as open data for Switzerland, plus tools for model evaluation 
    against benchmarks such as population records or a base model.
